<title>USA: Community Financial establishes annual div.</title>
<headline>Community Financial establishes annual div.</headline>
<dateline>OLNEY, Ill. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Financial Corp said Tuesday its board had established an annual dividend of $0.25 per share.</p>
<p>It said the dividend will be paid annaully on January 15, record the last Friday in December.</p>
<p>It said the first payout will be mailed January 15, record December 30.</p>
<p>Community Financial is the holding company for Community Bank &amp; Trust N.A.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
